# Python

CLI tool — no web frameworks.

## Prefer

- `asyncio` for I/O-bound orchestration
- `urllib.parse` for URL parsing
- Plain `dict` for result rows
- `httpx` for HTTP through SOCKS5 and GeoIP

## Avoid

- Extra modules for one-off helpers
- Structured logging frameworks — plain `print` is enough
- Logging credentials (UUIDs, full VLESS URLs)
